\p
\v 1 After¦99058 the¦99059 death¦99059 of¦99059 Yahweh's servant Mosheh \add !(Moses)\add*, Yahweh spoke¦99063 to¦99065 Mosheh's servant Yehoshua¦99067 \add !(Joshua¦99067)\add* (the¦99068 son¦99068 of¦99068 Nun¦99070), saying¦99073,
