\v 6 Be¦99159 strong¦99159 and¦99160 be¦99160 courageous¦99160, for¦99161 you yourself will¦99163 \add ≈lead\add* \add #these\add* people¦99166 to¦99163 inherit¦99163 the land¦99170 that¦99171 I¦99173 promised¦99173 their¦99174 ancestors¦99174 that I'd give¦99175 to¦99176 them¦99176.\x + \xo 1:6: \xt Deu 31:6-7,23.\x*
\v 7 Just¦99178 be¦99179 strong¦99179 and¦99180 very¦99181 courageous¦99180—making sure that¦99187 you¦99188 \add ≈obey everything\add* that my¦99190 servant¦99190 Mosheh¦99189 instructed¦99188 you. Don't¦99191 turn¦99193 away to the right¦99195 or to the left¦99196 from it, so¦99197 that¦99197 you'll¦99198 be wise in¦99199 every¦99199 \add ≈situation that you¦99201 end up in\add*.
