\v 9 Didn't¦99231 I¦99232 order you¦99232 to be¦99233 strong¦99233 and¦99234 courageous¦99234? Don't tremble or be discouraged¦99240 because¦99241 your¦99244 god¦99244 Yahweh¦99243 will be¦99242 with¦99242 you¦99242 wherever¦99246 you¦99247 go¦99247.”
