\p
\v 1 \add This was the land\add* that was¦106264 assigned to Yehudah's¦106268 descendants¦106267 according to¦106269 their¦106269 clans¦106269:
\p It went from the Zin¦106276 wilderness¦106274 in the south¦106277 to¦106277 the¦106272 border¦106272 with Edom¦106273,
\v 2 and¦106281 their southern border¦106283 was the¦106284 south-facing bay at the¦106285 end¦106285 of¦106285 the¦106286 \add ≈Dead Sea¦106286\add* \add (also called the Salt Sea)\add*.
\v 3 \add From there\add* it¦106294 went¦106294 south¦106297 of¦106298 the¦106298 Scorpion¦106299 Pass¦106300, across to¦106301 Zin¦106301, \add ≈climbed\add* up¦106302 to Kadesh¦106304-Barnea¦106305, crossed to Hezron¦106307, went¦106308 to¦106309 Addar¦106309, and¦106310 around to¦106311 Karka¦106311.
\v 4 Then¦106313 it¦106313 crosses to¦106314 Azmon¦106314 and¦106315 out¦106315 to the¦106316 Egyptian¦106317 riverbed¦106316 and¦106318 \add ≈finishes\add* at¦106322 the \add Mediterranean\add* sea. That¦106323 will¦106325 be¦106325 their southern¦106328 border¦106327.
