\v 5 The¦106330 eastern¦106331 border¦106330 was¦106332 the¦106332 \add ≈Dead Sea¦106332\add* as far as the¦106336 end¦106336 of¦106336 the¦106337 Yordan¦106337.
\p The¦106338 northern¦106340 border¦106338 \add starts\add* at the top of the \add ≈Dead Sea¦106342\add* where the Yordan¦106344 \add river\add* enters it
\v 6 then¦106346 to Beyt¦106348-Hoglah¦106349 and¦106350 \add further\add* north¦106351 to Beyt¦106352-Aravah to the¦106356 Stone¦106356 of¦106356 Bohan¦106358 (Reuben's¦106360 son¦106360).
\v 7 Then¦106362 the¦106363 border¦106363 went¦106362 to¦106365 Debir¦106365 from¦106366 the¦106366 Akor¦106367 Valley¦106366, and¦106368 to¦106368 the north¦106368, turning¦106369 to¦106370 the¦106372 Gilgal¦106372, which¦106373 is¦106375 in front of the Adummim¦106377 pass which¦106378 is¦106379 from¦106379 the¦106379 south¦106379 of¦106380 the riverbed¦106380, then¦106381 the¦106382 border¦106382 passed¦106381 over to¦106383 the¦106385 waters¦106385 of¦106385 Eyn¦106388-Shemesh and¦106389 it¦106390 ends at Eyn¦106393-Rogel¦106394.
\v 8 \add ≈From there\add* the¦106397 border¦106397 went¦106396 up¦106396 the¦106398 valley¦106398 of¦106398 Ben¦106398 Hinnom¦106399 to¦106402 the¦106404 edge of¦106404 the¦106405 Yebusite¦106405 region from¦106406 the¦106406 south¦106406 (that¦106407 is¦106408 Yerushalem¦106408). Then¦106409 the¦106410 border¦106410 went¦106409 to¦106411 the¦106413 head of¦106413 the¦106414 hill¦106414 opposite the Hinnom valley to the west¦106422, which¦106423 is¦106424 at¦106424 the¦106424 end¦106424 of¦106424 the¦106425 valley¦106425 of¦106425 the Refa'ites to¦106428 the north¦106428.
\v 9 \add ≈From there\add* the¦106431 border¦106431 turned¦106430 from¦106432 the¦106432 head of¦106432 the¦106433 hill¦106433 to¦106434 the¦106436 Neftoah spring¦106436 and¦106439 went¦106439 out¦106439 to¦106440 the¦106442 cities¦106442 of¦106442 Mt¦106443. Efron¦106445, then¦106446 the¦106447 border¦106447 turned¦106446 to Ba'alah (\add ≈now called\add* Kiriat¦106450-Yearim¦106451).
\v 10 Then¦106453 the¦106454 border¦106454 went around from¦106455 Ba'alah to the west¦106456 to Mt¦106459. Seir¦106460, and¦106461 passed¦106461 over to¦106462 the¦106464 shoulder of¦106464 Mt¦106465. Yearim¦106467 from¦106468 the north¦106468 (\add ≈also called\add* Kesalon¦106470), and¦106471 went¦106471 down¦106471 to Beyt¦106472-Shemesh¦106474, and¦106475 passed¦106475 over to Timnah¦106476.
\v 11 \add ≈From there\add* the¦106479 border¦106479 went¦106478 out¦106478 to¦106480 the¦106482 shoulder of¦106482 Ekron¦106483 to¦106484 the north¦106484, then¦106485 turned¦106485 toward Shikkeron¦106487 and¦106488 passed¦106488 over to Mt¦106489. Baalah¦106491, and¦106492 went¦106492 out¦106492 to Yabneel, then¦106494 the border¦106496 ended at¦106497 the sea.
\v 12 The¦106499 western border¦106499 was¦106501 the¦106501 \add ≈Mediterranean\add* Sea¦106501. Those were¦106505 the¦106505 borders¦106505 of¦106505 \add the land given to\add* Yehudah's¦106508 descendants¦106506 to be allocated to their¦106510 clans¦106510.
