\p
\v 13 Yahweh¦106525 had instructed Yehoshua¦106526 to¦106512 give¦106516 \add this\add* block of land to Caleb¦106512 (Yefunneh's¦106515 son¦106513): Kiriat¦106529-Arba¦106530 (\add ≈now called\add* Hebron¦106534—Arba was Anak's¦106532 father¦106531).\x + \xo 15:13-14: \xt Jdg 1:20.\x*
\v 14 Caleb¦106538 captured \add the land\add* from Anak's three¦106541 sons¦106542—Sheshai¦106546, Ahiman¦106549, and¦106550 Talmai¦106552,
\v 15 then¦106556 from¦106557 there¦106557, he \add ≈battled against¦106558\add* Debir (formerly¦106565 called¦106562 Kiriat¦106566-Sefer)
\v 16 ⇔and¦106570 \add *he¦106571\add* said¦106570, “I'll¦106581 give¦106581 my¦106586 daughter¦106586 Aksah¦106585 to marry \add ≈to the man who¦106572 attacks¦106574\add* Kiriat¦106577-Sefer and¦106580 captures¦106580 it.”
\v 17 Then¦106589 Othniel¦106590 (Kenaz's¦106593 son¦106591 and Caleb's¦106595 brother¦106594) captured¦106589 \add @the city\add*, \add ≈so¦106596\add* \add @Caleb¦106596\add* gave¦106596 his¦106602 daughter¦106602 Aksah¦106601 to¦106598 him¦106598 for¦106603 a¦106603 wife¦106603.
\v 18 Then¦106605 \add ≈when¦106606 she¦106606 married him\add*, she¦106607 \add ≈encouraged\add* him¦106607 to¦106608 ask¦106608 her¦106611 father¦106611 for a¦106612 field¦106612, \add ≈so¦106613\add* she¦106613 got down¦106613 off \add &her¦106615\add* donkey¦106615 and¦106616 Caleb¦106619 asked, “What¦106620 \add ≈are¦106622 you¦106622 up to\add*?”
\v 19 “Give¦106625 me¦106627 a¦106628 blessing¦106628,” she answered¦106624, “because¦106629 you've¦106632 given¦106632 me land¦106630 in the¦106631 Negev¦106631 \add desert region\add*, \add ≈so¦106633 now\add* give¦106633 me¦106634 some springs¦106635 \add as well\add* for water¦106636.” \add ≈So¦106637\add* he¦106637 gave¦106637 her¦106639 \add both\add* the upper¦106642 and¦106643 the lower¦106645 springs.
