\v 35 The¦108416 \add ≈fortified¦108417\add* cities¦108416 were¦108418 Tsiddim, Tser, Hammat¦108420, Rakkat, Kinneret¦108422,
\v 36 Adamah¦108424, Ramah¦108425, Hatsor¦108426,
