\v 38 Yiron¦108433, Migdal¦108434-El¦108436, Horem¦108437, Beyt¦108438-Anat, and¦108441 Beyt¦108441-Shemesh¦108442—\add a total of\add* nineteen cities¦108443 as well as their \add surrounding\add* villages¦108447.
\v 39 That¦108449 was¦108450 Naftali's¦108454 descendants¦108452' inheritance¦108450 according to¦108455 their¦108455 clans¦108455, \add including\add* those cities¦108456 as well as their \add surrounding\add* villages¦108457.
