\v 22 Kibzaim¦109223, and Beyt¦109229-Horon¦109230—four¦109235 cities¦109234 with their surrounding fields.
\v 23 From¦109238 Dan's¦109240 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Elteke, Gibbeton¦109249,
\v 24 Ayyalon¦109256, and¦109257 Gat¦109262-Rimmon¦109264—four¦109269 cities¦109268 with their surrounding fields.
\v 25 From¦109272 the Menashsheh¦109274 half-tribe's \add territory\add*, they were allocated Taanak¦109277 and Gat¦109283-Rimmon¦109285—two¦109290 cities¦109289 with their surrounding fields.
\v 26 ⇔\add Thus\add* the¦109298 \add other\add* Levite Kohat¦109300 clans¦109297 \add received\add* ten¦109295 cities¦109294 with their¦109296 surrounding fields.
\p
\v 27 The¦109304 Levite¦109307 Gereshon¦109305 clans¦109306 were allocated cities from¦109308 \add ≈within the Menashsheh¦109310 half-tribe's territory\add*: Golan¦109318 in¦109320 the Bashan¦109320 (which was assigned as a refuge¦109314 city¦109313 for anyone who \add accidentally\add* kills¦109315 someone) and Be'eshtarah—two¦109331 cities with their surrounding fields.
\v 28 From¦109334 Yissakar's¦109335 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Kishyon¦109338, Daberat¦109344,
\v 29 Yarmut¦109351, and¦109352 Eyn¦109357-Gannim¦109358—four¦109363 cities¦109362 with their surrounding fields.
\v 30 From¦109366 Asher's¦109367 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Mishal¦109370, Abdon¦109376,
\v 31 Helkat, and Rehob¦109389—four¦109394 cities¦109393 with their surrounding fields.
\v 32 From¦109397 Naftali's¦109398 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Kedesh¦109407 in¦109408 the Galilee¦109408 (which was assigned as a refuge¦109403 city¦109401 for anyone who \add accidentally\add* kills¦109404 someone), Hammot-Dor¦109415, and Kartan¦109421—three¦109426 cities¦109425 with their surrounding fields.
\v 33 \add Thus\add* the Levite Gereshon \add #clan¦109432\add* \add received\add* thirteen cities¦109436 with their¦109437 surrounding fields.
\p
\v 34 The¦109441 remaining¦109445 Levite¦109444 Merari¦109443 clans¦109440 were allocated \add ≡cities\add* from¦109446 \add ≈within Zebulun's¦109448 territory\add*: Yokneam¦109451, Kartah¦109457,
