\v 36 From¦109477 Reuben's¦109478 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Bezer¦109481, Yahaz¦109487,
\v 37 Kedemot¦109494, and Mephaat¦109500—four¦109505 cities¦109504 with their surrounding fields.
\v 38 From¦109508 Gad's¦109510 \add territory\add*, they were allocated Ramot¦109518 in¦109519 the Gilead¦109519 (which was assigned as a refuge¦109514 city¦109513 for anyone who \add accidentally\add* kills¦109515 someone), Mahanaim¦109525,
\v 39 Heshbon¦109532, and¦109533 Yazer¦109538—four¦109545 cities¦109544 with their surrounding fields.
\v 40 \add Thus\add* the Levite¦109555 Merari¦109551 clan¦109552 \add received\add* twelve cities in the¦109554 draw¦109557, along with their¦109557 surrounding fields.
\p
\v 41 \add So\add* altogether the Levites¦109564 received forty-eight cities¦109570 and their¦109573 surrounding fields from with the territories of¦109573 the \add ≈other tribes\add*—
\v 42 each¦109583 of those¦109577 cities had fields around¦109581 them \add for their livestock to graze on\add*.
\s1 The Israelis move into the regions
